Package: adamreview
Title: adam-review: Review CDISC ADaM Datasets in a Shiny App
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Shreya", "Sharma", , "sshreya319@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small golem-based Shiny application for exploring CDISC ADaM
    clinical trial datasets, comparing two datasets with 'diffdf', and
    downloading a parameterized Quarto HTML report. Built as a portfolio
    project to demonstrate clean, tested Shiny engineering.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
